  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Allow variable updates to affect timers",
    "splashDescription": "In a BPMN-based process, timers are normally only evaluated once. Therefore, any variables that are updated after the timer is evaluated do not affect the timer. To solve the problem, use this blueprint.",
